% podman-image-trust 1

## NAME
podman\-image\-trust - Manage container registry image trust policy

## SYNOPSIS
**podman image trust** *subcommand*

## DESCRIPTION
Manage container registry image trust policies.

Use the **set** subcommand to configure image trust policies and the **show** subcommand to display existing policies.

## COMMANDS

| Command | Man Page | Description |
| ------- | -------- | ----------- |
| set | [podman-image-trust-set(1)](podman-image-trust-set.1.md) | Set container registry image trust policy. |
| show | [podman-image-trust-show(1)](podman-image-trust-show.1.md) | Display container registry image trust policy. |

## SEE ALSO
